+---
+id: task-004-hourly-equipment-rentals
+type: task
+title: "Hourly equipment rentals"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Allow customers to rent equipment for periods shorter than one day when both endpoints fall on a UTC
+hour. `addEquipment` accepts an optional hourly price in euro cents; hourly rentals require it and cost
+one hourly price per hour. Preserve complete-day pricing, discounts, booking conflict checks, and
+availability behavior.
